     RECT-5 AT ROW 16 COL 3
     RECT-6 AT ROW 1.24 COL 70 WIDGET-ID 44
    WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY 
         SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D 
         AT COL 1 ROW 1
         SIZE 160 BY 28.24.


